N,I|             white underwear and bra underneath. She stretches her back             
N|             like a cat. Her curved silhouette is intoxicating.                     
N|             The train comes to a brief stop at the station and, outside            
N|             the other window, Rachel can see work crews fixing the                 
N|             tracks. And beyond them, the Hudson River.                             
O|
O|                                                              (CONTINUED)           
O|
